9,Indigenous music and dance in Taiwan is undergoing major regeneration,https://melbourneasiareview.edu.au/indigenous-music-dance-taiwan-major-regeneration/,"Different singing practices (pasibutbut, uyas kmeki, mayasvi, etc.) across Taiwan can therefore be understood as diverse approaches to polyphony. The range and clearly defined types of Indigenous polyphony in Taiwan stand out within Austronesian music-cultural studies.",N’kep,Austronesian
